  "actions": [
    {
      "title": "Fix sizing first \u2014 it is the biggest leak",
      "detail": "Wrong size is the top return reason: 47 of 217 returns (21.66%), costing PKR 157,156 (25.51% of all money lost). Fashion is the worst category (30.17% return rate, PKR 317,659 lost) and Women's Lawn 3pc Suit is the worst product by rate (33.33%, 32 of 96 orders). Publish real measurements and a size chart on the Fashion listings before spending on anything else."
    },
    {
      "title": "Tighten the Daraz channel",
      "detail": "Daraz has the highest return rate at 21.3% (82 of 385 orders), against Facebook at 14.67%, and lost PKR 212,039. Check that its listing photos, sizes and descriptions match what is actually shipped \u2014 the gap against the Website channel is a listing problem, not a customer problem."
    },
    {
      "title": "Quality-check before dispatch, starting with Electronics",
      "detail": "Defective/damaged (32 returns, PKR 50,337 lost) plus wrong item sent (25 returns, PKR 38,590 lost) cost PKR 88,927 together \u2014 every one of those is a return the store caused. Running Sneakers alone lost PKR 105,378 (27 returns). A one-minute check before sealing the box removes most of it."
    },
    {
      "title": "Plan for the sale spike before the next one",
      "detail": "2026-03 had the highest return rate of the half year (23.73%, 56 returns) and 2026-04 lost the most money (PKR 156,761). Sale months bring the volume \u2014 and the returns. Staff the returns desk and tighten size and quality checks before the next sale, not after it."
    }
  ]
